{"3060210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Toey Weedz Smoke One", "steam_appid": 3060210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4959110], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/6d7ceb7570a2ff1a6bd7d68dd2ef2e0a.avif?t=1784641189\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras_big/6d7ceb7570a2ff1a6bd7d68dd2ef2e0a.avif?t=1784641189 width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Evil Ones are back again!<br>The Worldz full of D!cks and only Toey Weedz can stop em! <br>But is he gonna do it? <br>Because usually he dont gives a F... <br>Only plays the good old retro gamez and smoking the weedz.. <br>But this time its something personal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/84174520982d02577ccac1862b152cd9.poster.avif?t=1784641189\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/84174520982d02577ccac1862b152cd9.webm?t=1784641189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/84174520982d02577ccac1862b152cd9.mp4?t=1784641189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taken away his own plants and his only hobby, the smoking of good weedz</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he is now pushed to the limit, conquering the worldz, killing the d!cks and gettin the plants he needs! <br>To pay his depts and to buy his equipment..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/a534f859c84650ec2c587ed8e6e1e8ab.avif?t=1784641189\" width=500 height=140 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 6 unique designed Levels, and experience a story about Toey Weedz and his arch enemy Arnold D!ckler </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clever, from early retrogames inspired leveldesign, with a Hub as a center Point, Collectibles and many different tasks will delight you for several hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy Equipment and weapons to be prepared for the next level </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let Toey hang out in his own room with different designoptions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay depts, to put an end to the madness once and for all </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This thing is different from anything you've ever played, guaranteed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toey Weedz Smoke One is a slightly different first-person shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine a game that you knew from back then and is still exactly as you remember it today, even though it was never released before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is Toey Weedz Smoke One!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/c645cc133ae5cf6266f1a3f97225d759.poster.avif?t=1784641189\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/c645cc133ae5cf6266f1a3f97225d759.webm?t=1784641189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/c645cc133ae5cf6266f1a3f97225d759.mp4?t=1784641189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% handmade (based on the Unreal Engine4)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro shooter of a slightly different kind with the best from the past combined with features from the modern era! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tobias Alexander Knobloch has created a game out of his love of life and the early 3D retro console games that stands out in a variety of areas due to its uniqueness and comedic craziness and will always remind you how wonderful, or annoying, video games were in your childhood! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/6d7ceb7570a2ff1a6bd7d68dd2ef2e0a.avif?t=1784641189\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras_big/6d7ceb7570a2ff1a6bd7d68dd2ef2e0a.avif?t=1784641189 width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Evil Ones are back again!<br>The Worldz full of D!cks and only Toey Weedz can stop em! <br>But is he gonna do it? <br>Because usually he dont gives a F... <br>Only plays the good old retro gamez and smoking the weedz.. <br>But this time its something personal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/84174520982d02577ccac1862b152cd9.poster.avif?t=1784641189\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/84174520982d02577ccac1862b152cd9.webm?t=1784641189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/84174520982d02577ccac1862b152cd9.mp4?t=1784641189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taken away his own plants and his only hobby, the smoking of good weedz</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he is now pushed to the limit, conquering the worldz, killing the d!cks and gettin the plants he needs! <br>To pay his depts and to buy his equipment..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/a534f859c84650ec2c587ed8e6e1e8ab.avif?t=1784641189\" width=500 height=140 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 6 unique designed Levels, and experience a story about Toey Weedz and his arch enemy Arnold D!ckler </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clever, from early retrogames inspired leveldesign, with a Hub as a center Point, Collectibles and many different tasks will delight you for several hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy Equipment and weapons to be prepared for the next level </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let Toey hang out in his own room with different designoptions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay depts, to put an end to the madness once and for all </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This thing is different from anything you've ever played, guaranteed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toey Weedz Smoke One is a slightly different first-person shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine a game that you knew from back then and is still exactly as you remember it today, even though it was never released before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is Toey Weedz Smoke One!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/c645cc133ae5cf6266f1a3f97225d759.poster.avif?t=1784641189\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060210/extras/c645cc133ae5cf6266f1a3f97225d759.webm?t=1784641189\